@startuml
title 7. Discovery / nearby — cache hit
autonumber
participant Client
participant Gateway
participant Spatial
database Redis
database SpatialDB

Client -> Gateway : GET /spatial/nearby?lat&lon&radius&categories (Bearer)
Gateway -> Gateway : validate JWT
Gateway -> Spatial : forward (X-User-Id set)
Spatial -> Spatial : build cache key\n(rounded geohash + radius + categories)
Spatial -> Redis : GET key
Redis --> Spatial : cached POIs (user-free)
Spatial -> SpatialDB : poi_unlock WHERE user_id = ? AND osm_id = ANY(ids)\n(decoration AFTER the cache, per user)
SpatialDB --> Spatial : unlocked osm_ids of this user
Spatial --> Client : 200 [POIs] (unlocked flag per user)
note right of Spatial : the cache key has no user dimension and is unchanged;\nthe per-user flag is never written into the cached payload.
@enduml
